 Conditionals: 2 (two ternaries) → 8\n- Constants: 0\n- Loops: 0\n- Assignments: 0\n- **Total Mass: 19**\n\n*After refactor:*\n```ts\nconst premiumForGroup = (type: string, count: number): number => {\n  const unitPremium = unitPremiumFor(type);\n  if (COMPONENT_TYPES.has(type) && count === COMPONENT_BLOCK_SIZE) {\n    return COMPONENT_BLOCK_PREMIUM;\n  }\n  return count * unitPremium;\n};\n```\n- Bindings: 3 (`type`, `count`, `unitPremium`)\n- Invocations: 2 (`unitPremiumFor`, `has`) → 4\n- Conditionals: 1 (`if`) → 4\n- Constants: 0\n- Loops: 0\n- Assignments: 0\n- **Total Mass: 11**\n\n**Mass Change:** 19 → 11 (Δ −8)\n\n**Simple Design Rules Check**\n1. **Tests pass:** `pnpm test` → 17 passing, 16 todo.\n2. **Reveals intent:** Removed the misleading `componentBlockPremium`; the block-discount rule is now explicit inside `premiumForGroup`.\n3. **No duplication:** The fallback `count * unitPremium` now appears only once.\n4. **Fewest elements:** One helper function removed.\n\n**Tests:** All passing."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","usage":{"input":524,"output":2053,"cacheRead":15808,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1370,"totalTokens":18385,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784970588530,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-53afc928-76de-43e2-84a4-21c08e532ca4","responseModel":"moonshotai/kimi-k2.7-code"}],"stderr":"","usage":{"input":4113,"output":8339,"cacheRead":68800,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":0,"contextTokens":18385,"turns":6},"model":"requesty/tensorx/kimi-k2.7-code","stopReason":"stop"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1784970596970},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Read current file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"functions.read:105","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_08-56-23_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2.1-phase-continuation-pi_kimi-k2-7/src/claim-o